            "content": "Cho hình lăng trụ <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"18\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image162.png\" width=\"82\"/> có tất cả các cạnh bằng <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"14\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image163.png\" width=\"14\"/>, <img class=\"is-diagram\" height=\"26\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image164.png\" width=\"164\"/>. Gọi <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"16\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image165.png\" width=\"22\"/> là trung điểm của <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"18\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image166.png\" width=\"26\"/>; <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"18\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image167.png\" width=\"18\"/> là điểm thỏa mãn <img class=\"math-img-inline\" height=\"42\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image168.png\" width=\"82\"/>. <img class=\"is-diagram\" height=\"310\" id=\"Picture 10187\" src=\"k12_de01/temp_exam_files/image169.jpg\" width=\"329\"/>",
